WEBVTT

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:18.686
[sighs] All right, think, think, think.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:19.812
You got this. You got this.

00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:21.355
What are we doing? What are we doing?

00:00:22.732 --> 00:00:24.233
-The forge!
-The what?

00:00:24.317 --> 00:00:26.694
We're gonna throw
the whole thing into the fire.

00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:28.029
It's our last chance.

00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:29.238
You got this, buddy.

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:34.410
Here... we... go!

00:00:51.636 --> 00:00:53.721
[song ends]

00:00:58.392 --> 00:00:59.811
[gasps]

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:23.918
[helicopter blades whirring]

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.002
Huh?

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.671
[sirens blaring]

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.011
Well, well, well. [laughs]

00:01:34.095 --> 00:01:37.306
Not so tough without your hot dog truck,
are you, Wolf?

00:01:45.148 --> 00:01:46.858
Ooh. Wow!

00:01:48.276 --> 00:01:49.777
This is getting real.

00:01:51.362 --> 00:01:53.281
Morning, ladies.

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.408
Madam Governor.

00:01:55.491 --> 00:01:58.077
Oh, yeah. Foxenstein, right?

00:01:58.828 --> 00:01:59.912
Close enough.

00:02:02.081 --> 00:02:04.000
What are you doing here?

00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:07.336
You know, I'm very hands-on.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.756
Especially when someone tries
to frame my friends.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.008
I know everything.

00:02:12.091 --> 00:02:13.885
The MacGuffinite. The magnet.

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:16.304
Hmm. You talked to Marmalade.

00:02:16.387 --> 00:02:18.723
Actually, he did most of the talking.

00:02:19.223 --> 00:02:20.850
I'm more of an action girl.

00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:22.935
[exciting music playing]

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:25.980
Step aside before anger
becomes punch.

00:02:26.063 --> 00:02:27.273
[snorts, roars]

00:02:39.869 --> 00:02:41.204
[both grunting]

00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:46.083
[yelps]

00:02:49.003 --> 00:02:50.046
[Diane grunts]

00:02:56.886 --> 00:02:58.554
[panting] You're all under arrest.

00:02:59.055 --> 00:03:00.431
Governor's orders.

00:03:01.015 --> 00:03:02.016
[exclaims]

00:03:02.099 --> 00:03:03.184
Feisty!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.479
-You don't know, do you?
-[chuckles]

00:03:06.562 --> 00:03:08.189
You're not governor anymore.

00:03:08.272 --> 00:03:09.941
You might wanna
check your phone.

00:03:10.024 --> 00:03:11.442
Crimson Paw.

00:03:11.525 --> 00:03:13.653
-Crimson-- What?
-[phone beeping]

00:03:16.489 --> 00:03:17.490
[Diane] No.

00:03:17.573 --> 00:03:18.950
No, no, no. But--

00:03:23.496 --> 00:03:24.622
[Diane stammers]

00:03:24.705 --> 00:03:26.040
How... How?

00:03:26.123 --> 00:03:27.124
[gasps]

00:03:32.588 --> 00:03:35.341
[Pigtail tuts] They never expect the dart.

00:03:36.842 --> 00:03:37.969
[Kitty] Shall we?

00:03:38.052 --> 00:03:39.428
[pants, groans]

00:03:40.471 --> 00:03:41.472
[Diane] Kitty!

00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:44.767
[panting] Kitty.

00:03:55.361 --> 00:03:56.654
[groans]

00:03:59.782 --> 00:04:01.200
A viral video has revealed

00:04:01.284 --> 00:04:04.120
<i>that the notorious thief
known as The Crimson Paw</i>

00:04:04.203 --> 00:04:07.790
was none other
than Governor Diane Foxington.

00:04:07.873 --> 00:04:10.209
While police search
for the rogue politician,

00:04:10.293 --> 00:04:13.129
they have wasted no time
in ordering the speedy release

00:04:13.212 --> 00:04:16.048
of sweet, adorable Professor Marmalade.

00:04:16.132 --> 00:04:18.217
Unlike the Bad Guys,

00:04:18.301 --> 00:04:22.763
whose claim to have "changed”
fooled absolutely no one.

00:04:22.847 --> 00:04:25.308
Chief, we were set up
by a gang of super criminals.

00:04:25.391 --> 00:04:26.892
They turned the MacGuffinite
into a gold magnet.

00:04:26.976 --> 00:04:27.977
[officer] Back in line!

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.479
And they're stealing that rocket
to take it to space.

00:04:30.563 --> 00:04:32.606
Yeah, that's what they all say.

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.525
Ch-Chief, I know it looks bad,

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.321
but if we did this why would
we help you solve the case?

00:04:38.404 --> 00:04:40.406
Why would we tell you
about the MacGuffinite?

00:04:40.489 --> 00:04:41.490
And where's the loot?

00:04:41.574 --> 00:04:42.825
You know it doesn't add up.

00:04:43.326 --> 00:04:44.869
Look, we don't have proof.

00:04:44.952 --> 00:04:48.998
But I know somewhere
in that big, booming heart of yours

00:04:49.081 --> 00:04:51.917
you know we didn't do this.

00:04:52.668 --> 00:04:53.794
Chief, please.

00:04:56.922 --> 00:04:59.633
How many times
do I have to tell you, Wolf?

00:04:59.717 --> 00:05:01.552
It's Commissioner.

00:05:06.307 --> 00:05:07.808
[grunts]

00:05:12.271 --> 00:05:13.647
[Kitty] Ready to fly this thing?

00:05:13.731 --> 00:05:16.317
With watch, rocket flies itself.

00:05:22.865 --> 00:05:25.076
Hey, Jenny. You seeing this?

00:05:25.159 --> 00:05:26.160
[gasps]

00:05:28.329 --> 00:05:29.497
[growls]

